"the administrator policy {policy} disables network access and names no model "
"servers (model_url_prefixes), so models cannot be downloaded. {import}"
msgstr ""
"la directiva del administrador {policy} desactiva el acceso a la red y no "
"indica ningún servidor de modelos (model_url_prefixes), por lo que no se "
